  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "playstyle",
      "title": {
        "en": "Playstyle"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "Diana Heart Breakers and Quietus"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1061_srt4",
              "name": "With All My Heart!",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 1,
                "name": "With All My Heart! I",
                "text": {
                  "en": "[Quietus] 150% Damage. Create 3 Heart Breaker."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Heart Breakers are the most simple type of Heart Bullet that Diana makes\nHeart Breakers are just for damage, or to discard bullets (Shaker>Breaker)\nUsing a Heart Breaker\n80% Damage\nAlso discards a random Bullet that is in hand\nDiscarding Heart Breaker (Not very good idea)\n120% Extra Attack Damage to random enemy\nQuietus + Discarding Heart Breaker\n80% Damage\n120% Extra Attack Damage\n2 hits\nQuietus is Diana's Keyword that just means \"Activate upon Discard\"\nIf the card has a discard effect, both effects will activate"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Heart Shakers and Resonance"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1061_cre2",
              "name": "Heart Shaker",
              "cost": 0,
              "text": {
                "en": "[Bullet] [Haste] [Exhaust] 1 Resonance. Discard 1 random card(s) in Draw Pile. When this card is Discarded, 2 Resonance to a random enemy."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Heart Shakers are the other Bullet Diana can make\nHeart Shakers are mainly used for Resonance\nResonance is a debuff enemies get from Diana\nResonance deals 80% Extra Attack Damage each time a card is discarded\nHeart Shaker since it gives Resonance is most Equivalent to a Multi Hit card\n1 Resonance x 80% and each Resonance can scale from Moral, so its strong\nUsing a Heart Shaker\nDiscards one random from Draw Pile\nAlso consumes the 1 Resonance it makes, if possible\nDiscarding Heart Shaker, gives 2 Resonance to someone random\nQuietus + Discarding Heart Shaker\n3 Resonance inliction\n1 Resonance Consumption\n3 hit x 80%, but 2 are just delayed"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Diana Ego Skill and Cupid Shot"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1061_cre3",
              "name": "Cupid Shot",
              "cost": 1,
              "text": {
                "en": "[Bullet] [Quietus] 120% Damage. 60% Extra Attack × Bullet card count in hand to a random enemy."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Using Diana's Ego Skill to create Cupid Shot early is a good idea, since it doesn't have exhaust\nOtherwise it can create discard fodder of 2 Heart Bullets"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
