            "en": "Pistol 1: Equivalent to 180% + 80% x 3\nPistol 2: Equivalent to 180% + 80% x 5, but the condition is much harder to achieve consistently\nPistol 3: Activating 10 Resonance at a time is a bit excessive, and also doesnt generate Resonance\nPistol 4: This requires roughly 3 bullet discards before beating Pistol 1, after that Moral is required\nPistol 5: Completely Unnessicary, because discarding already activates Resonance gradually"
